me  a week later kavan and the no pets  arrived in koru  there they were to hand off the cargo to  the local militia  on arrival kevin noticed that all of  them were heavily armed with russian  weapons  one by one the containers were opened  and checked  cavend began to laugh as on opening the  first cargo doors revealed that they  were in fact pineapples  however after clearing these aside the  true intention of this delivery was made  known  the container was packed to the brim  with volkov multi-munition launchers  russian rocket launchers  but before anyone could say a word the  sound of gunfire began to echo around  them  and american troops started flooding  into the area  while trying to duck for cover kevin was  struck by a bullet causing him to  immediately pass out  by the time he'll work he was on the  back of a flatbed truck and escaping the  battlefield  his wounds were being tended to by maria  who was frantically wrapping bandages  around the gunshot wound to his abdomen  while fleeing the war zone kavan ended  up on board a ship that was heading  toward russia's oil station on  antarctica  with the rapidly rising sea levels by  2039 countries were finally starting to  understand the importance of leaving  antarctica and its ice alone  everyone except the russians  who in secret were violating the  international treaty that was protecting  the ice continent from drilling  eventually over time the remote science  facility located at queen moordland  quietly became a refining operation  responsible for up to four thousand  barrels of crude oil  daily  it was here that no pets from across the  globe would visit this area to refuel  however recently things were beginning  to change  as the fight for control and dominance  between russia and america continued to  grow  the superpowers were looking for ways in  which to bolster their influence  and now the oil was being cut off to the  no pets  the only way now to get it from this  facility is to swear allegiance to  russia  this was a price that oz is unwilling to  pay  now stranded on the continent with  nothing much to do  kevin stumbles across another nopat  specialist this one by the name of  constantine angel  whose own vessel has been stuck here for  three weeks  angel states that this is practically a  hostage situation and that ultimately  war is coming  it's only a matter of time until america  comes for this place  as more time passes  more and more nope vessels are winding  up stranded here debating the offer of  fuel for fealty  the cold in isolation is crippling  and many take the bargain  witness to this angel comments on how  short-sighted this is  that no pets shouldn't be choosing sides  he says to think of poland in world war  one their country hadn't been on the map  for 150 years  the polish legion did whatever for  whomever to make sure that when the dust  settled they still had a country  sometimes war is the only way home  kevin begins to recognize this rallying  called arms  it's something that oz has been saying  for a long time  and it ultimately works to keep his  notepads intact and on mission  suddenly loud falcons sound  and on the horizon a large american  destroyer can be seen making its way  towards the facility  this is quickly followed by the sound of  two large cannons being fired from the  shore  the american ship returns a warning shot  and over a loudspeaker a confident voice  orders the russians to stand down  the flag the ship is flying is the no  pet emblem  later kavan would find out that oz had  sent his most trusted captain to rescue  the stranded notepads before they  succumbed to the russian demands  kavan made his way aboard the ship along  with the other refugees  in his head eckhardt would angel had  said and all he could hear was those  words being repeated over and over again  there was a fight coming and it was  something he wanted no part in  yet there he was  stranded aboard a warship  maybe oz is right and war  