e  which would only prolong the inevitable  even further  by 6 30 pm the crew are finally able to  see freetown port on the horizon  currently only specialist rao is aware  of kavan's plans to disembark  but soon this wouldn't matter  the warship suddenly starts veering away  from the direction they were headed  taking a left turn they're now heading  north  [Music]  kavan can't believe his eyes  they were so close to the port  why have they suddenly changed course  where are they headed  he rushes to the bridge to find answers  when he gets there he sees a familiar  sight  an old telegraph machine much like the  one on the copper field  oz had sent new orders  before the captain slams the bridge door  closed caven hears one last thing coming  through the comms  we have one shot at a new future  and we're going to take it  [Music]  [Music]  you

